WEBVTT

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.020
Shriv: I think we just won.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:42.920
Iden: Heads up.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:45.180
Del: Oh. Hello, your highness.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:49.240
Leia: Good work out there, but I’d expect nothing less from Inferno Squad.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.440
Iden: So you've spoken to General Calrissian.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.020
Leia: You’ve done a lot of damage to this Alliance.

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:03.140
Iden: Yes we have ma’am. And there’s no excuse for it.

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:09.860
Leia: Watching you fight today, it’s clear you're not just running from the Empire. This means something to you.

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:20.720
Iden: It does. We've been fighting our whole lives. It's taken us too long to realize that we were fighting for the wrong side.

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:28.760
Iden: This war is far from over. We would like to help you, if you’ll let us.

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:41.360
Leia: People like you are the reason hope can prevail. Hope is the reason we’re going to win.

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:44.860
Leia: Welcome to the New Republic.

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:46.660
Iden: Thank you, ma'am.
